title: KillerIntro
---
You enter the house and find an odd creature staring at you. This was the source of your sense of dread.
But you can also sense something else. There are what feels like pieces of your heart scattered around this house.
Maybe if you collect them you can uncover the truth of what you are doing here.
The odd creature begins chasing you. You must flee.
===

title: CollectedIntro
---
Somehow, after completing the puzzle you find yourself back at the entrance of the manor.
You have collected all the pieces, and you feel yourself getting closer to the answer, but the killer is still chasing you.
Maybe the exit to the back garden is open to you now...
===


title: BackGarden
---
By the skin of your teeth, you escape from the creature chasing you...
===

title: CannotEnter
---
This feels like where you are supposed to go, but you feel as though you cannot enter yet.
Maybe you have to finish gathering the pieces.
===